purpose operation jwtTokenSigner "Authority to issue and verify HS256 access tokens through the native JWT runtime."
capability sqliteDatabaseReadWriter database readWrite
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReadWriter "Authority to persist auth rate-limit and audit rows through standard.sqlite."
capability processEnvironmentReader process.environment read
purpose operation processEnvironmentReader "Authority to read deployment auth configuration from process environment variables."

